WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 7=

22
01:56.721 --> 01:57.321
Wait,

23
01:58.601 --> 01:59.562
I asked my mom about it.

24
01:59.601 --> 02:00.801
She said Liren even wanted

25
02:00.922 --> 02:02.282
to interview Lu Hui one-on-one.

26
02:03.002 --> 02:04.161
They went into the study,

27
02:04.521 --> 02:05.961
and after the interview,

28
02:06.161 --> 02:07.321
he reluctantly hired Lu Hui.

29
02:07.562 --> 02:08.842
So Liren didn't know this

30
02:08.921 --> 02:09.881
in advance.

31
02:10.242 --> 02:11.201
And both of them tacitly

32
02:11.282 --> 02:12.842
pretended not to know each other.

33
02:13.282 --> 02:14.601
Di Liren wanted to

34
02:14.641 --> 02:15.601
hide his past marriage.

35
02:16.962 --> 02:17.881
Then why

36
02:18.321 --> 02:19.481
did he let her stay?

37
02:19.921 --> 02:20.761
Maybe

38
02:21.082 --> 02:22.082
Lu Hui used it

39
02:22.082 --> 02:22.761
to blackmail him.

40
02:24.362 --> 02:25.201
What does she want?

41
02:26.041 --> 02:26.842
I'm not sure yet.

42
02:27.761 --> 02:28.201
Right.

43
02:28.641 --> 02:29.041
Today...

44
02:29.041 --> 02:29.481
Meng.

45
02:33.041 --> 02:33.562
Meng.

46
02:37.041 --> 02:37.641
Meng.

47
02:42.402 --> 02:44.441
This is the new caregiver, Duan.

48
02:44.881 --> 02:46.122
She's been working here

49
02:46.441 --> 02:47.242
and is experienced.

50
02:47.481 --> 02:47.761
Hello.

51
02:47.842 --> 02:49.161
The head nurse recommended me.

52
02:49.161 --> 02:50.641
I just got off my shift on 3rd floor.

53
02:50.682 --> 02:51.481
I can start working

54
02:51.522 --> 02:52.201
right away.

55
02:53.201 --> 02:53.562
Hello.

56
02:54.161 --> 02:54.752
Out to talk?

57
02:54.802 --> 02:55.041
Okay.

58
02:55.481 --> 02:56.082
Let's go, Duan.

59
02:59.601 --> 03:00.562
Ms. Hui,

60
03:01.041 --> 03:02.842
did my parents meet Duan already?

61
03:03.161 --> 03:04.201
Yes, just now.

62
03:04.721 --> 03:06.002
She is very experienced.

63
03:06.041 --> 03:06.761
She can

64
03:06.802 --> 03:07.962
crank the bed silently.

65
03:08.282 --> 03:09.362
She even memorized

66
03:09.441 --> 03:10.242
all those drug names

67
03:10.362 --> 03:11.242
with their effects.

68
03:11.962 --> 03:12.802
That's great.

69
03:13.802 --> 03:14.161
Meng,

70
03:14.522 --> 03:15.321
you can go back.

71
03:16.082 --> 03:16.962
Let me instruct her.

72
03:17.802 --> 03:18.161
Duan,

73
03:18.362 --> 03:19.122
while I'm here,

74
03:19.441 --> 03:20.641
ask me anything you need.

75
03:21.242 --> 03:22.242
I'll walk you through it.

76
03:23.522 --> 03:24.481
Make sure

77
03:24.761 --> 03:26.601
to finish his assisted exercises

78
03:26.842 --> 03:28.242
every morning before breakfast.

79
03:28.481 --> 03:28.881
Got it?

80
03:29.161 --> 03:30.201
And inside that room...

81
03:32.402 --> 03:33.601
(The new caregiver is here.)

82
03:33.761 --> 03:35.402
(Lu Hui is leaving.)

83
03:36.962 --> 03:37.921
(She saved your dad)

84
03:38.082 --> 03:39.682
(and earned your family's gratitude.)

85
03:40.802 --> 03:42.161
(Logically, she shouldn't leave.)

86
03:42.362 --> 03:43.282
(To transfer assets,)

87
03:43.282 --> 03:44.682
(Di Liren needs someone he trusts.)

88
03:45.201 --> 03:45.881
(Given)

89
03:45.881 --> 03:46.881
(her thing with him,)

90
03:47.201 --> 03:47.682
(right now,)

91
03:48.321 --> 03:49.881
(she's my prime suspect.)

92
03:50.641 --> 03:51.481
(If she leaves,)

93
03:51.962 --> 03:53.082
(we'll lose this lead.)

94
03:53.921 --> 03:55.041
(Find a way to keep her.)

95
04:23.122 --> 04:23.722
I can't do it.

96
04:24.482 --> 04:25.922
If I fall from here,

97
04:26.362 --> 04:27.881
I'll be maimed or worse.

98
04:39.521 --> 04:40.122
A little lower.

99
04:47.042 --> 04:47.482
Whatever.

100
04:48.961 --> 04:49.841
No pain,

101
04:50.362 --> 04:51.162
no gain.

102
04:52.002 --> 04:52.521
I'm doing it.

103
04:58.482 --> 04:58.922
Easy.

104
05:02.362 --> 05:03.401
Watch your head!

105
05:08.761 --> 05:09.321
Slow down.

106
05:09.321 --> 05:10.362
My foot!

107
05:19.122 --> 05:20.002
Meng wants me

108
05:20.002 --> 05:21.201
to look after her for a while.

109
05:21.682 --> 05:22.562
I'll leave

110
05:22.602 --> 05:23.341
once she's better.

111
05:25.321 --> 05:26.802
Didn't you already resign?

112
05:27.201 --> 05:27.922
Why stay?

113
05:28.081 --> 05:29.042
You're busy with work,

114
05:29.761 --> 05:31.242
and she might hold you back.

115
05:32.042 --> 05:32.922
You'll get busier.

116
05:33.042 --> 05:34.042
If I don't watch you,

117
05:34.961 --> 05:36.562
you'll break your word.

118
05:38.482 --> 05:39.242
What if she

119
05:39.242 --> 05:40.562
posts your video online?

120
05:40.841 --> 05:41.562
Aren't you afraid?

121
05:41.722 --> 05:42.961
You can handle it.

122
05:43.841 --> 05:44.922
You won't let her post it.

123
05:45.281 --> 05:46.122
I can't promise that.

124
05:46.802 --> 05:47.802
I can hire a caregiver

125
05:48.201 --> 05:49.162
to replace you.

126
05:49.201 --> 05:50.081
Did you forget?

127
05:50.521 --> 05:51.562
Your wife hates strangers

128
05:51.562 --> 05:52.441
in the house.

129
05:52.562 --> 05:53.641
I'm the only option.

130
05:55.122 --> 05:56.401
I'll hand things over to Duan

131
05:56.761 --> 05:57.722
and move in later.

132
06:10.321 --> 06:11.042
(Do me a favor.)

133
06:23.722 --> 06:24.162
Who's this?

134
06:24.761 --> 06:25.321
Hello, Mr. Di.

135
06:25.602 --> 06:26.281
This is Jiao Xu.

136
06:26.802 --> 06:27.881
You came to see me before.

137
06:29.602 --> 06:30.162
Sure,

138
06:30.162 --> 06:31.002
what's up?

139
06:31.401 --> 06:32.081
Well,

140
06:32.961 --> 06:33.881
I've been thinking

141
06:33.881 --> 06:34.802
the case you mentioned

142
06:34.961 --> 06:36.081
about your friend.

143
06:37.081 --> 06:38.201
It sounds quite interesting.

144
06:38.722 --> 06:40.242
And a client of mine just decided

145
06:40.242 --> 06:41.281
not to divorce.

146
06:41.482 --> 06:42.722
So now my schedule is open.

147
06:43.242 --> 06:43.841
What a pity.

148
06:44.562 --> 06:45.401
You've missed it.

149
06:45.961 --> 06:46.881
My friend

150
06:47.321 --> 06:48.602
has retained another lawyer.

151
07:01.321 --> 07:02.242
It's ironic, huh?

152
07:03.162 --> 07:04.881
I've been trying to hunt for mistresses,

153
07:05.641 --> 07:06.602
only to find out

154
07:07.002 --> 07:08.081
I'm the mistress.

155
07:08.722 --> 07:09.482
Another mistress...

156
07:11.002 --> 07:11.482
Careful.

157
07:12.042 --> 07:13.401
She is actually his first wife!

158
07:13.761 --> 07:15.201
Who knew they hid it that well?

159
07:15.881 --> 07:16.841
Don't blame yourself.

160
07:18.081 --> 07:19.281
But what are you thinking?

161
07:19.562 --> 07:21.002
Why did you let Lu Hui move in?

162
07:22.602 --> 07:24.122
If she moves in,

163
07:24.321 --> 07:25.122
I can

164
07:25.122 --> 07:26.281
observe them up close.

165
07:27.841 --> 07:28.922
I want to see

166
07:29.281 --> 07:30.641
how they interact,

167
07:30.841 --> 07:31.847
if they trust each other,

168
07:32.321 --> 07:33.081
and whether they

169
07:33.242 --> 07:34.641
team up out of self-interest

170
07:34.761 --> 07:35.761
or out of affection

171
07:35.761 --> 07:36.521
as exes.

172
07:36.722 --> 07:37.761
I want to know it all.

173
07:37.881 --> 07:39.562
Who would want to work

174
07:39.562 --> 07:40.521
in an ex's house?

175
07:40.761 --> 07:41.841
Seeing you and Liren

176
07:41.881 --> 07:42.362
together,

177
07:42.562 --> 07:43.482
wouldn't that hurt her?

178
07:44.002 --> 07:45.362
That's not my problem.

179
07:47.922 --> 07:49.281
Think about it, Zi.

180
07:50.602 --> 07:51.881
If Lu Hui really

181
07:52.042 --> 07:53.002
still has feelings

182
07:53.042 --> 07:53.922
for Liren,

183
07:54.602 --> 07:55.441
wouldn't that give me

184
07:55.482 --> 07:56.242
a great opening?

185
07:56.401 --> 07:57.401
I can drive them apart

186
07:57.521 --> 07:58.441
and get something

187
07:58.482 --> 07:59.401
on Liren.

188
07:59.521 --> 08:00.641
If she still has feelings

189
08:00.722 --> 08:01.441
for him,

190
08:01.494 --> 08:02.401
isn't it risky for you

191
08:02.401 --> 08:03.401
to live together?

192
08:05.562 --> 08:07.321
Why not install hidden cameras at home?

193
08:10.002 --> 08:11.362
I thought about it,

194
08:12.042 --> 08:12.761
but...

195
08:14.002 --> 08:14.802
Both of them are

196
08:14.802 --> 08:15.841
more vigilant than I am.

197
08:16.242 --> 08:17.321
It might backfire on me.

198
08:18.042 --> 08:18.682
Besides,

199
08:18.802 --> 08:19.802
it's my house.

200
08:20.042 --> 08:21.122
What can they do to me?

201
08:21.722 --> 08:22.761
That would expose them.

202
08:29.081 --> 08:29.722
Mr. Jiao.

203
08:33.921 --> 08:34.482
Mr. Jiao.

204
08:35.002 --> 08:36.521
I asked you to keep her,

205
08:37.362 --> 08:38.842
not to hurt yourself.

206
08:40.761 --> 08:42.842
Well, no pain, no gain.

207
08:44.161 --> 08:45.242
I was defensive before.

208
08:45.561 --> 08:46.921
Now, I'm playing offense.

209
08:47.722 --> 08:48.801
You even had me call Liren

210
08:48.801 --> 08:49.521
deliberately,

211
08:49.722 --> 08:50.999
pretending you dropped the case

212
08:51.082 --> 08:52.681
to lower his guard.

213
08:54.602 --> 08:55.202
Spill it.

214
08:55.530 --> 08:56.242
What's your plan?

215
08:59.401 --> 09:00.602
I'm going back to the company.

216
09:01.128 --> 09:02.543
(May boss's wife stay young and pretty)

217
09:02.561 --> 09:03.921
My dad's in poor health right now.

218
09:04.641 --> 09:05.482
I don't dare tell him

219
09:05.521 --> 09:06.322
what Liren is doing.

220
09:07.722 --> 09:08.761
The priority now

221
09:08.921 --> 09:10.082
is to figure out

222
09:10.202 --> 09:11.641
how the company is really doing,

223
09:12.161 --> 09:13.082
find leverage on him,

224
09:13.442 --> 09:14.401
and protect my assets.

225
09:15.002 --> 09:15.801
(May boss's wife stay young and pretty) Before,

226
09:16.281 --> 09:17.722
I was too naive.

227
09:18.561 --> 09:19.362
From now on,

228
09:20.161 --> 09:21.161
I'm not the boss's wife.

229
09:22.161 --> 09:23.082
I'm the boss.

230
09:43.842 --> 09:44.521
What's wrong?

231
09:45.202 --> 09:45.842
Can't sleep?

232
09:53.761 --> 09:54.362
Why slap me?

233
09:54.602 --> 09:55.681
You're so annoying!

234
09:56.921 --> 09:58.122
You pissed me off in my dream.

235
09:58.161 --> 09:59.322
I was furious!

236
10:01.641 --> 10:02.761
So it was just a nightmare.

237
10:06.401 --> 10:07.041
Tell me,

238
10:07.082 --> 10:08.122
how did I upset you?

239
10:08.401 --> 10:09.082
Get lost.

240
10:09.842 --> 10:10.921
I could kill you right now.

241
10:13.242 --> 10:14.041
Come on.

242
10:14.681 --> 10:16.082
You'll feel better once you say it.

243
10:16.442 --> 10:17.242
You took me

244
10:17.242 --> 10:18.281
to a dinner party.

245
10:19.442 --> 10:20.921
There were so many people there,

246
10:21.962 --> 10:22.881
but you didn't

247
10:22.921 --> 10:23.921
introduce me to them.

248
10:24.722 --> 10:25.761
Then you opened the door.

249
10:26.602 --> 10:27.322
Right after that,

250
10:27.722 --> 10:29.242
a bunch of gorgeous women walked in.

251
10:30.242 --> 10:31.401
Everyone crowded around them

252
10:31.921 --> 10:33.641
and called them all "Meng".

253
10:34.442 --> 10:37.362
Nobody paid attention to me.

254
10:38.281 --> 10:41.002
You had so many Mengs!

255
10:41.602 --> 10:42.561
Come on.

256
10:42.722 --> 10:43.602
That's ridiculous.

257
10:44.482 --> 10:45.641
Then I woke up terrified.

258
10:47.281 --> 10:48.681
And when I woke up,

259
10:49.041 --> 10:50.521
my chest felt so tight.

260
10:50.561 --> 10:51.161
It was awful.

261
10:52.041 --> 10:53.362
I could barely breathe.

262
10:54.242 --> 10:54.962
Only after

263
10:55.002 --> 10:56.202
I slapped you just now

264
10:57.122 --> 10:58.681
did I finally feel better.

265
11:01.362 --> 11:02.002
Honey,

266
11:02.521 --> 11:03.962
did I hit you too hard?

267
11:04.161 --> 11:05.122
Did it hurt?

268
11:05.921 --> 11:06.521
It's fine.

269
11:07.521 --> 11:08.442
It didn't hurt at all.

270
11:09.401 --> 11:10.602
As long as you're not mad.

271
11:12.082 --> 11:13.041
It's my fault.

272
11:13.314 --> 11:13.801
I shouldn't

273
11:13.801 --> 11:14.722
have taken you there.

274
11:16.881 --> 11:17.561
All right,

275
11:17.681 --> 11:18.362
don't be mad.

276
11:18.681 --> 11:19.281
Go to bed.

277
11:21.122 --> 11:21.442
Come on.

278
11:23.681 --> 11:24.322
Wait a second.

279
11:24.602 --> 11:25.122
Come on.

280
11:25.641 --> 11:26.401
Careful.

281
11:27.641 --> 11:28.561
Easy.

282
11:29.801 --> 11:30.362
Stand steady.

283
11:30.641 --> 11:31.401
Let me pull if off.

284
11:32.881 --> 11:33.962
Let me help you, honey.

285
11:37.881 --> 11:38.722
It's okay.

286
11:40.482 --> 11:42.401
Why can't I do anything right?

287
11:42.962 --> 11:44.242
I'm just holding you back.

288
11:45.482 --> 11:46.521
If this keeps up,

289
11:47.521 --> 11:49.002
someone will replace me eventually.

290
11:49.202 --> 11:50.002
There, there.

291
11:50.242 --> 11:50.962
Don't cry.

292
11:51.962 --> 11:52.722
It's no big deal.

293
11:52.842 --> 11:54.082
Anyone can knock things over.

294
11:54.281 --> 11:55.322
You're being sensitive.

295
11:56.602 --> 11:57.482
It's my fault.

296
11:57.962 --> 11:58.641
A dinner

297
11:58.722 --> 12:00.041
gave you so much pressure.

298
12:00.322 --> 12:01.002
Honey,

299
12:02.322 --> 12:03.122
I know why.

300
12:04.202 --> 12:05.561
I have too much free time.

301
12:06.161 --> 12:07.281
No wonder people say

302
12:07.561 --> 12:09.281
idle hands make trouble.

303
12:09.722 --> 12:10.761
How about this, honey?

304
12:11.561 --> 12:12.921
Find me something to do,

305
12:13.161 --> 12:14.242
so I can get back on track.

306
12:14.281 --> 12:14.761
Please.

307
12:15.002 --> 12:15.921
Then tell me.

308
12:16.122 --> 12:16.962
What do you want?

309
12:17.801 --> 12:18.322
Shopping?

310
12:20.641 --> 12:21.281
Traveling?

311
12:23.362 --> 12:25.002
Throwing parties?

312
12:27.681 --> 12:28.442
I don't know

313
12:28.442 --> 12:29.842
what I want to do either,

314
12:30.482 --> 12:32.082
but I just don't want to sit around.

315
12:32.561 --> 12:33.442
Honey,

316
12:33.602 --> 12:34.801
I'm really at the office.

317
12:34.881 --> 12:35.842
I'm not lying to you.

318
12:36.842 --> 12:37.801
Show me over there.

319
12:38.602 --> 12:39.041
Okay.

320
12:40.921 --> 12:41.602
See?

321
12:43.281 --> 12:44.242
Don't move so fast.

322
12:44.242 --> 12:45.202
I can't see clearly.

323
12:45.602 --> 12:46.401
Okay, I'll be slow.

324
12:46.521 --> 12:47.202
One more time.

325
12:50.002 --> 12:51.442
For our new product line,

326
12:51.921 --> 12:53.401
the quality...

327
12:54.344 --> 12:55.176
(My Dear Wife)

328
12:57.761 --> 12:58.442
The quality

329
12:58.801 --> 13:00.242
of our new product line

330
13:00.482 --> 13:01.281
must be guaranteed

331
13:01.442 --> 13:02.122
as always,

332
13:02.602 --> 13:03.281
and we also...

333
13:03.880 --> 13:06.744
(My Dear Wife)

334
13:10.401 --> 13:11.041
Excuse me.

335
13:12.962 --> 13:14.322
We must ensure quality

336
13:14.482 --> 13:16.281
and ramp up marketing

337
13:16.641 --> 13:18.082
to promote across all channels.

338
13:18.082 --> 13:18.681
(Mrs. Di)

339
13:18.681 --> 13:19.161
Meanwhile,

340
13:19.401 --> 13:19.921
- we... - Mr. Di,

341
13:20.801 --> 13:21.681
Mrs. Di is calling.

342
13:34.602 --> 13:34.962
Hello?

343
13:36.161 --> 13:36.681
Honey,

344
13:36.681 --> 13:38.401
I'm really bored.

345
13:38.561 --> 13:39.273
Go find Liu Zi.

346
13:40.002 --> 13:41.041
She's swamped.

347
13:41.122 --> 13:42.233
She told me not to bug her.

348
13:44.442 --> 13:45.842
You said you wanted to keep busy.

349
13:46.962 --> 13:47.602
Any ideas?

350
13:49.442 --> 13:50.002
Sure.

351
13:54.561 --> 13:55.082
Honey,

352
13:55.401 --> 13:56.405
I'm going back to work.

353
14:17.962 --> 14:18.602
Honey,

354
14:19.681 --> 14:20.521
did you decide

355
14:20.561 --> 14:21.442
to get back to work

356
14:21.801 --> 14:23.122
just to buy all these desk toys?

357
14:23.761 --> 14:24.641
So what?

358
14:24.881 --> 14:27.082
Work should be fun too.

359
14:27.602 --> 14:28.761
Look at this wooden fish.

360
14:29.442 --> 14:30.122
Isn't it cute?

361
14:31.322 --> 14:32.921
Tap it, and get merit.

362
14:33.202 --> 14:35.002
Tap it again, and get merit again.

363
14:36.482 --> 14:37.482
How old are you?

364
14:37.801 --> 14:38.881
You're like a child.

365
14:40.442 --> 14:41.161
Let me guess.

366
14:41.722 --> 14:42.681
You already

367
14:42.722 --> 14:43.986
picked out your first-day suit?

368
14:44.161 --> 14:45.041
I almost forgot!

369
14:45.362 --> 14:45.842
Ms. Hui,

370
14:46.122 --> 14:47.161
could you iron my clothes?

371
14:47.681 --> 14:48.082
Sure.

372
15:05.242 --> 15:06.681
She suddenly wants to work.

373
15:07.442 --> 15:08.122
Why?

374
15:08.641 --> 15:09.521
Could it be

375
15:09.561 --> 15:10.362
that she is

376
15:11.281 --> 15:12.242
up to something?

377
15:14.641 --> 15:15.281
I don't know.

378
15:16.161 --> 15:16.881
But

379
15:17.122 --> 15:18.401
given all the stuff she bought,

380
15:19.641 --> 15:20.801
it's just like an impulse.

381
15:21.082 --> 15:22.722
Doesn't look like she's going to work.

382
15:23.242 --> 15:23.881
Maybe.

383
15:25.602 --> 15:26.722
I found this in her room.

384
15:27.521 --> 15:27.962
(Yihe Firm) I checked.

385
15:28.362 --> 15:29.161
This law firm

386
15:29.161 --> 15:30.602
specializes in divorce litigation.

387
15:34.801 --> 15:35.561
It's handled.

388
15:36.082 --> 15:36.681
Are you sure?

389
15:37.681 --> 15:38.881
She'd never divorce me.

390
15:39.550 --> 15:41.057
She can't even handle the water bill.

391
15:41.482 --> 15:42.921
Without me, what can she do?

392
15:44.881 --> 15:46.362
Fine, as long as you took care of it.

393
15:47.362 --> 15:48.641
What do you wear for tomorrow?

394
15:48.921 --> 15:50.161
Let me iron your shirt.

395
15:50.482 --> 15:51.921
No need. I'll do it myself.

396
15:54.281 --> 15:55.641
You're both going to work,

397
15:56.401 --> 15:57.801
so what am I supposed to do here?

398
15:58.082 --> 15:59.122
I have to do something.

399
16:02.962 --> 16:04.002
Aren't you so independent,

400
16:04.602 --> 16:05.921
always figuring things out alone?

401
16:06.362 --> 16:07.041
Why ask me

402
16:07.322 --> 16:08.202
about it then?

403
16:20.362 --> 16:20.962
Honey,

404
16:21.561 --> 16:22.082
what made you

405
16:22.122 --> 16:23.041
clean this room?

406
16:23.761 --> 16:24.715
Someone staying over?

407
16:24.801 --> 16:25.401
It's me.

408
16:26.362 --> 16:27.122
Ms. Hui,

409
16:27.722 --> 16:29.322
give me a hand, please.

410
16:30.242 --> 16:32.002
The doctor said my leg can't bear weight.

411
16:32.432 --> 16:33.761
You always roll onto me at night.

412
16:33.761 --> 16:35.122
I need to sleep alone to recover.

413
16:35.401 --> 16:35.801
Ms. Hui,

414
16:35.962 --> 16:36.801
change the sheets.

415
16:37.202 --> 16:37.602
Sure.

416
16:38.602 --> 16:39.041
Wait.

417
16:40.521 --> 16:41.041
Honey,

418
16:41.641 --> 16:42.641
we can switch sides.

419
16:42.921 --> 16:43.641
So at night,

420
16:43.722 --> 16:44.669
I won't roll onto you.

421
16:45.161 --> 16:46.281
I've told you so many times.

422
16:46.322 --> 16:47.521
I can't sleep on your side.

423
16:47.921 --> 16:48.848
Ms. Hui, ignore him.

424
16:48.921 --> 16:49.482
Do what I say.

425
16:49.671 --> 16:50.387
I call the shots.

426
16:53.242 --> 16:53.801
But

427
16:54.161 --> 16:55.242
this room was meant

428
16:55.561 --> 16:56.602
for Ms. Hui.

429
16:56.801 --> 16:57.482
Oh, right.

430
16:59.722 --> 17:01.202
Ms. Hui just moved in today,

431
17:01.362 --> 17:02.962
and this was supposed to be hers.

432
17:03.242 --> 17:04.642
But what can I do?

433
17:04.682 --> 17:06.081
I have to listen to the doctor.

434
17:07.242 --> 17:08.242
How about this, Ms. Hui?

435
17:09.041 --> 17:10.561
Could you make do

436
17:10.922 --> 17:12.402
with the nursery

437
17:12.402 --> 17:12.882
for a while?

438
17:13.922 --> 17:14.482
No problem.

439
17:14.962 --> 17:15.521
Thanks.

440
17:15.841 --> 17:17.002
See? She's fine with it.

441
17:18.121 --> 17:18.722
How about this?

442
17:19.242 --> 17:20.205
Master bedroom's yours.

443
17:20.321 --> 17:21.081
I'll sleep here.

444
17:21.561 --> 17:22.442
No.

445
17:23.281 --> 17:24.041
This room

446
17:24.402 --> 17:25.402
is closer to Ms. Hui's.

447
17:25.482 --> 17:27.002
I can call her if I need anything.

448
17:27.442 --> 17:28.801
You sleep like a log,

449
17:28.801 --> 17:29.631
dead to the world.

450
17:29.761 --> 17:30.521
You can't help.

451
17:32.202 --> 17:32.642
Ms. Hui,

452
17:33.162 --> 17:33.682
do your work.

453
17:53.144 --> 17:56.763
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

454
17:58.648 --> 18:02.330
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

455
18:02.792 --> 18:05.135
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

456
18:05.544 --> 18:07.928
♪I fall into the abyss♪

457
18:15.544 --> 18:18.872
♪Shadows torn apart by moonlight♪

458
18:20.936 --> 18:24.376
♪Shards can't piece together tomorrow♪

459
18:24.808 --> 18:27.624
♪You set gentle traps♪

460
18:27.624 --> 18:30.344
♪Trapping me in place♪

461
19:15.561 --> 19:16.923
(Crashing at your place tonight.)

462
19:16.923 --> 19:17.970
(Be there in ten minutes.)

463
19:24.962 --> 19:25.601
The guest room

464
19:25.682 --> 19:26.561
was already empty.

465
19:27.041 --> 19:27.521
I don't know

466
19:27.521 --> 19:28.361
when Meng left.

467
19:29.242 --> 19:30.002
Could she...?

468
19:30.882 --> 19:31.442
She told me

469
19:32.321 --> 19:33.162
she's out shopping.

470
19:38.121 --> 19:39.242
If you're this scared,

471
19:39.482 --> 19:40.402
you should have left.

472
19:43.041 --> 19:43.482
I'm done.

473
19:43.801 --> 19:44.482
I'm off to work.

474
19:50.601 --> 19:51.561
Why is it you again?

475
19:51.682 --> 19:52.841
Don't you have other cases?

476
19:53.002 --> 19:54.682
Is your firm doing that bad?

477
19:54.922 --> 19:56.321
Yu Meng paid me four times my rate,

478
19:56.521 --> 19:58.198
so I'm putting in four times the effort.

479
19:59.642 --> 20:00.722
Let's start

480
20:00.841 --> 20:02.281
with Jiali's structure.

481
20:04.761 --> 20:05.882
The current chairman?

482
20:06.162 --> 20:06.882
You all know.

483
20:07.242 --> 20:08.882
(Di Liren) Under his strategic guidance,

484
20:09.402 --> 20:11.121
Jiali was restructured

485
20:11.242 --> 20:12.442
into three divisions.

486
20:13.801 --> 20:14.321
I know.

487
20:14.841 --> 20:15.642
Zhang Yu is

488
20:15.801 --> 20:16.882
at the Product Center.

489
20:17.561 --> 20:17.962
Correct.

490
20:18.761 --> 20:19.922
(The Product Center)

491
20:20.242 --> 20:22.442
(owns Jiali's entire product pipeline, like design,)

492
20:22.882 --> 20:24.281
(R&amp;D, production, and QC.)

493
20:24.761 --> 20:25.801
(So the Product Center)

494
20:25.962 --> 20:27.442
(is where it all starts.)

495
20:31.521 --> 20:32.601
The Brand Center is led

496
20:32.962 --> 20:33.642
by Gao Shan.

497
20:34.521 --> 20:35.962
You and Gao Shan were colleagues.

498
20:36.281 --> 20:37.922
(While Brand Center and Product Center)

499
20:38.041 --> 20:39.162
(sound very similar,)

500
20:39.442 --> 20:40.202
(what they do)

501
20:40.242 --> 20:41.242
(couldn't be)

502
20:41.482 --> 20:42.242
(more different.)

503
20:42.442 --> 20:43.761
Gao Shan mainly handles PR,

504
20:44.162 --> 20:46.442
(Brand Director: Gao Shan) marketing, and advertising.

505
20:46.682 --> 20:47.922
And the last division.

506
20:51.801 --> 20:52.801
E-Commerce Center,

507
20:53.041 --> 20:54.002
headed

508
20:54.361 --> 20:54.882
by Luo Ye.

509
20:55.841 --> 20:57.442
(Riding the live commerce boom,)

510
20:57.722 --> 20:59.642
(Jiali broke through)

511
20:59.642 --> 21:00.634
(in the domestic cosmetics market.)

512
21:00.922 --> 21:02.202
(Though the E-Commerce Center)

513
21:02.281 --> 21:03.121
(was created last,)

514
21:03.321 --> 21:04.642
(it is just as vital)

515
21:04.801 --> 21:05.604
(as the other two.)

516
21:06.162 --> 21:07.482
Sorry to interrupt you,

517
21:07.601 --> 21:09.121
but what does any of this have to do

518
21:09.121 --> 21:10.002
with Meng's audit?

519
21:10.361 --> 21:12.722
If I handed you the books right now,

520
21:13.242 --> 21:14.041
could you read it?

521
21:14.402 --> 21:15.002
No.

522
21:15.281 --> 21:16.722
Could you tell which stage

523
21:16.801 --> 21:18.002
Di Liren tampered with?

524
21:18.321 --> 21:19.041
Production,

525
21:19.601 --> 21:20.242
sales,

526
21:20.601 --> 21:21.202
or marketing?

527
21:22.682 --> 21:23.642
Don't worry.

528
21:24.041 --> 21:25.402
Since I've made up my mind,

529
21:25.722 --> 21:27.601
I'll learn whatever it takes.

530
21:27.841 --> 21:29.321
You can ask Di Liren

531
21:29.361 --> 21:30.202
to rotate you

532
21:30.321 --> 21:31.402
through every division.

533
21:31.962 --> 21:32.922
Rotating keeps her

534
21:32.962 --> 21:33.761
from core work.

535
21:34.962 --> 21:36.202
It won't help her.

536
21:36.882 --> 21:37.361
Right.

537
21:37.962 --> 21:38.841
I just remembered.

538
21:39.162 --> 21:40.722
When my dad was in the hospital,

539
21:41.081 --> 21:42.123
Mr. Dong came to see him

540
21:42.601 --> 21:43.601
and mentioned mismatches

541
21:43.722 --> 21:44.682
in the company accounts.

542
21:45.081 --> 21:46.202
He wanted to discuss it.

543
21:47.202 --> 21:47.841
When I asked him

544
21:47.922 --> 21:49.202
for specifics,

545
21:49.922 --> 21:50.962
he gave a fuzzy answer

546
21:51.121 --> 21:52.041
and sounded unsure.

547
21:53.642 --> 21:54.162
Wen Xiaoxiao,

548
21:54.561 --> 21:55.682
you work under Mr. Dong.

549
21:56.361 --> 21:57.482
Do you know what happened?

550
21:58.242 --> 21:59.041
Purchasing?

551
21:59.402 --> 21:59.922
Purchasing?

552
22:00.761 --> 22:01.402
A buyer working

553
22:01.402 --> 22:02.841
at Jiali for over a decade

554
22:03.482 --> 22:04.561
left last year,

555
22:04.922 --> 22:06.202
and Di Liren hired a new buyer.

556
22:06.841 --> 22:08.242
Mr. Dong mentioned tactfully

557
22:08.521 --> 22:09.442
that procurement costs

558
22:09.601 --> 22:10.642
became higher than before.

559
22:11.041 --> 22:12.002
But Di Liren claimed

560
22:12.281 --> 22:13.922
it was due to normal product upgrades.

561
22:15.121 --> 22:16.402
Get the supplier list

562
22:16.642 --> 22:17.563
and check one by one.

563
22:18.482 --> 22:19.242
The supplier list

564
22:19.242 --> 22:20.482
is confidential.

565
22:21.202 --> 22:22.642
It's not accessible for all staff.

566
22:23.002 --> 22:23.561
I can't get it

567
22:23.561 --> 22:24.722
as the boss's wife,

568
22:24.922 --> 22:25.722
or Di Liren

569
22:25.841 --> 22:26.962
will find out immediately.

570
22:28.361 --> 22:29.841
Which division oversees procurement?

571
22:31.642 --> 22:32.442
The Product Center.

572
22:34.922 --> 22:35.801
That's your target.

573
22:36.394 --> 22:37.321
Once you start to work,

574
22:37.321 --> 22:38.442
your first priority

575
22:38.801 --> 22:40.002
is to get

576
22:40.841 --> 22:41.722
into that place.

577
22:50.008 --> 22:53.976
♪I don't need the world to define how special I am♪

578
22:53.976 --> 22:55.032
(Long live Dad)

579
22:55.922 --> 22:57.482
(Everyone has their own agenda)

580
22:57.521 --> 22:58.081
(and goals.)

581
22:58.561 --> 22:59.041
(I get it.)

582
22:59.521 --> 23:00.482
But life

583
23:01.002 --> 23:02.162
(Go Princess!) won't wait until I'm fully prepared

584
23:02.202 --> 23:02.841
to move forward.

585
23:03.281 --> 23:04.321
(I have to learn as I go,)

586
23:04.601 --> 23:05.402
(step-by-step.)

587
23:06.162 --> 23:07.068
(I'm not discouraged,)

588
23:07.321 --> 23:08.081
(because I know)

589
23:08.722 --> 23:09.801
(in this world,)

590
23:10.202 --> 23:11.202
(haste)

591
23:11.642 --> 23:13.041
(could make efficiency.)

592
23:15.162 --> 23:16.121
Excuse me,

593
23:16.121 --> 23:17.242
take care of these calls.

594
23:17.801 --> 23:18.121
Sure.

595
23:18.321 --> 23:18.922
Morning.

596
23:19.081 --> 23:20.361
- Good morning, Mrs. Di. - Good morning, Mrs. Di.

597
23:20.561 --> 23:20.962
Morning.

598
23:21.368 --> 23:25.368
♪So lovely, lovely, lovely♪

599
23:26.202 --> 23:26.841
(Yu Meng) Hello.

600
23:28.072 --> 23:30.840
♪I never fail♪

601
23:31.601 --> 23:32.162
How is it?

602
23:32.922 --> 23:34.002
I designed this myself.

603
23:34.601 --> 23:35.561
They did this

604
23:35.561 --> 23:36.202
all night.

605
23:43.402 --> 23:43.882
Honey,

606
23:44.361 --> 23:45.642
(Brand Ambassador: Yu Meng) what exactly does

607
23:46.002 --> 23:47.121
a Brand Ambassador do?

608
23:47.882 --> 23:50.081
Be beautiful, elegant, and confident.

609
23:51.002 --> 23:51.442
Honey,

610
23:51.962 --> 23:53.722
you're the best face for Jiali.

611
23:58.488 --> 24:00.824
♪Even the wind is enchanted by me♪

612
24:00.824 --> 24:03.608
♪Even a wrong step turns into an iconic scene♪

613
24:03.608 --> 24:07.442
♪Even my meltdowns have my tone♪

614
24:07.442 --> 24:07.962
Ms. Zhang.

615
24:09.922 --> 24:10.482
Meng.

616
24:11.402 --> 24:11.922
Ms. Zhang,

617
24:12.321 --> 24:14.041
it's my first day back at work.

618
24:14.561 --> 24:15.882
I hope to learn a lot from you.

619
24:16.722 --> 24:17.162
Go for it.

620
24:17.722 --> 24:18.332
By the way,

621
24:19.121 --> 24:20.321
I brought you a little gift.

622
24:20.722 --> 24:21.485
Scented candles.

623
24:21.642 --> 24:22.321
It can help

624
24:22.321 --> 24:23.242
ease your stress a bit.

625
24:23.521 --> 24:24.361
Hope you like it.

626
24:28.521 --> 24:29.162
Thank you.

627
24:30.561 --> 24:31.162
Ms. Zhang,

628
24:31.922 --> 24:33.121
although my current title

629
24:33.281 --> 24:34.642
is Brand Ambassador,

630
24:36.041 --> 24:37.242
I'm still very interested

631
24:37.281 --> 24:38.722
in the Product Center.

632
24:39.162 --> 24:40.361
I'd love to talk with you.

633
24:41.281 --> 24:42.801
I have a meeting right now,

634
24:42.841 --> 24:45.041
so I'm afraid I don't have time.

635
24:45.081 --> 24:45.722
No problem.

636
24:45.922 --> 24:47.242
Just the time for a quick coffee.

637
24:47.962 --> 24:49.041
I bought coffee and snacks

638
24:49.321 --> 24:50.081
for everyone.

639
24:50.561 --> 24:51.962
You've all been working hard

640
24:52.121 --> 24:52.761
on the launch.

641
24:53.242 --> 24:54.882
Lunch break is extended by half an hour,

642
24:55.162 --> 24:56.081
without overtime.

643
24:56.882 --> 24:58.761
- Thank you, Mr. Di! - Thank you, Mr. Di!

644
25:01.922 --> 25:02.482
Honey,

645
25:03.281 --> 25:03.841
for you.

646
25:04.841 --> 25:05.482
Thanks, honey.

647
25:06.722 --> 25:07.442
On your first day,

648
25:07.682 --> 25:08.321
don't

649
25:08.361 --> 25:08.962
be tense.

650
25:09.361 --> 25:09.985
Take it easy.

651
25:11.601 --> 25:11.922
Come on.

652
25:16.121 --> 25:16.841
What is this?

653
25:17.361 --> 25:18.364
I hired a photographer.

654
25:18.882 --> 25:19.442
This is

655
25:19.482 --> 25:20.402
your huge milestone.

656
25:20.761 --> 25:22.002
We have to capture it.

657
25:34.121 --> 25:34.601
Excuse me,

658
25:34.962 --> 25:35.699
can I take a look?

659
25:41.482 --> 25:42.722
You take great photos.

660
25:42.761 --> 25:43.361
This camera

661
25:43.361 --> 25:44.642
is perfect for portraits.

662
25:47.321 --> 25:48.041
Listen,

663
25:48.242 --> 25:49.002
we usually

664
25:49.002 --> 25:49.882
don't have much time

665
25:49.962 --> 25:50.962
to take nice photos.

666
25:51.081 --> 25:52.402
Why don't we have him

667
25:52.521 --> 25:53.521
take shots of everyone

668
25:53.521 --> 25:54.002
today?

669
25:54.162 --> 25:55.561
- Sounds great! - Sounds great!

670
25:55.761 --> 25:56.482
Listen,

671
25:56.761 --> 25:58.242
if you see any shots you like,

672
25:58.321 --> 25:59.402
just ask our photographer

673
25:59.601 --> 26:00.281
to touch them up.

674
26:00.442 --> 26:02.121
Consider it a company perk.

675
26:02.242 --> 26:04.121
- Great. - Thanks, Meng.

676
26:04.882 --> 26:05.722
You're welcome.

677
26:16.561 --> 26:17.642
Not the triumphant return

678
26:17.682 --> 26:19.202
you imagined, huh?

679
26:20.801 --> 26:21.761
I didn't expect everyone

680
26:22.041 --> 26:23.561
to be so skeptical of my comeback.

681
26:24.202 --> 26:25.482
Di Liren set up your office

682
26:25.601 --> 26:26.442
like that

683
26:26.841 --> 26:27.962
just to make everyone

684
26:28.002 --> 26:28.922
resent you.

685
26:29.321 --> 26:30.722
He hired a photographer

686
26:31.321 --> 26:32.361
just to make you look like

687
26:32.642 --> 26:33.521
you're not

688
26:33.722 --> 26:34.882
taking work seriously,

689
26:35.601 --> 26:37.442
making things harder for you.

690
26:38.081 --> 26:38.801
I know.

691
26:39.121 --> 26:40.242
That's why I need to connect

692
26:40.882 --> 26:42.002
with Zhang Yu quickly.

693
26:42.002 --> 26:42.922
Zhang Yu

694
26:43.081 --> 26:44.402
already put your scented candle

695
26:44.561 --> 26:45.321
on her desk.

696
26:45.722 --> 26:46.642
She must like it.

697
26:48.801 --> 26:50.041
You're kind of helpful,

698
26:50.202 --> 26:51.281
catering to her tastes.

699
26:51.642 --> 26:53.682
Still, I must be quick.

700
26:54.121 --> 26:55.162
Once Di Liren

701
26:55.281 --> 26:56.321
gets suspicious,

702
26:57.041 --> 26:57.801
it'll become harder

703
26:57.801 --> 26:59.002
to get the procurement data.

704
27:00.482 --> 27:01.601
Be prepared.

705
27:02.121 --> 27:03.081
They won't accept you

706
27:03.081 --> 27:03.601
quite easily.

707
27:04.202 --> 27:05.361
Your sudden disappearance

708
27:05.722 --> 27:07.242
canceled the product launch,

709
27:08.002 --> 27:08.682
and all the work

710
27:08.841 --> 27:09.841
went down the drain.

711
27:11.482 --> 27:13.482
Have you ever read old romance novels?

712
27:14.202 --> 27:15.162
We're the assistants

713
27:15.162 --> 27:16.202
around the CEO.

714
27:16.682 --> 27:18.361
When he wants to please his lady,

715
27:18.601 --> 27:20.041
we're at his beck and call.

716
27:20.601 --> 27:21.281
That's how

717
27:21.321 --> 27:22.482
we feel about you right now.

718
27:22.682 --> 27:24.081
I'm sorry

719
27:24.442 --> 27:25.882
for disappearing like that.

720
27:26.482 --> 27:27.202
From now on,

721
27:27.801 --> 27:28.801
I'll make up for it.

722
27:31.442 --> 27:32.682
Check this out.

723
27:32.761 --> 27:33.922
They felt your goodwill.

724
27:36.081 --> 27:37.002
(Company perk from the boss's wife!) Someone posted

725
27:37.121 --> 27:37.801
retouched photos

726
27:37.801 --> 27:39.321
on WeChat Moments,

727
27:39.642 --> 27:40.841
thanking you for the perk.

728
27:41.561 --> 27:42.601
Most workers

729
27:42.761 --> 27:44.561
look like a mess on weekdays.

730
27:45.202 --> 27:46.385
They rarely take nice photos,

731
27:46.717 --> 27:47.679
so it's worth posting.

732
27:48.202 --> 27:49.521
You're a total people person.

733
27:50.041 --> 27:51.202
As long as it works.

734
27:51.601 --> 27:52.682
Di Liren wants everyone

735
27:52.682 --> 27:53.521
to reject me,

736
27:53.882 --> 27:54.642
so I can't let him

737
27:54.642 --> 27:55.922
get his way.

738
27:57.962 --> 27:59.361
Nothing is scarier

739
27:59.801 --> 28:01.121
than a resentful workforce.

740
28:01.521 --> 28:02.682
Go for it, Miss Boss.

741
28:04.242 --> 28:04.841
I'm off.

742
28:05.442 --> 28:05.962
Bye.

743
28:06.561 --> 28:07.882
It's not time to clock out yet.

744
28:07.922 --> 28:08.442
Leaving?

745
28:10.081 --> 28:11.722
Since there's nothing I can do here,

746
28:12.682 --> 28:13.882
I'll try at home.

747
28:14.361 --> 28:15.202
Two-way approach.

748
28:15.682 --> 28:16.321
Bye.

749
28:22.521 --> 28:23.202
Medicine time.

750
28:23.682 --> 28:24.242
Give it to me.

751
28:28.162 --> 28:29.761
Open wide, honey.

752
28:31.962 --> 28:32.561
Water.

753
28:38.162 --> 28:39.002
Candy, honey.

754
28:41.002 --> 28:42.162
Here's your candy.

755
28:48.281 --> 28:49.601
Thanks, Yong.

756
29:02.521 --> 29:03.242
Say that again?

757
29:05.521 --> 29:06.321
Yong.

758
29:06.922 --> 29:07.601
Didn't they

759
29:07.601 --> 29:08.402
call you that?

760
29:09.041 --> 29:10.121
Ms. Hui, guess what?

761
29:10.402 --> 29:11.402
He had a former name,

762
29:11.402 --> 29:12.361
Fang Yong.

763
29:12.722 --> 29:13.601
Still, I think

764
29:14.002 --> 29:14.761
Di Liren

765
29:14.761 --> 29:15.601
sounds much nicer.

766
29:15.841 --> 29:16.642
What do you think?

767
29:18.722 --> 29:20.801
Di Liren...

768
29:21.281 --> 29:22.682
It sounds like,

769
29:23.162 --> 29:23.722
well,

770
29:24.002 --> 29:25.682
the hero in a novel.

771
29:27.242 --> 29:27.761
Sounds great.

772
29:37.962 --> 29:38.442
Spill it.

773
29:39.361 --> 29:40.321
What are you up to now?

774
29:41.561 --> 29:43.361
I'm not up to anything.

775
29:45.281 --> 29:46.442
I just find adjusting to work

776
29:46.482 --> 29:47.561
so hard.

777
29:48.202 --> 29:49.321
I remember

778
29:49.682 --> 29:50.682
when you were in sales,

779
29:50.761 --> 29:52.242
you were top sales in a store, right?

780
29:53.521 --> 29:54.561
What's wrong, honey?

781
29:56.202 --> 29:57.682
When you were Fang Yong,

782
29:57.841 --> 29:59.202
did you have any dark past?

783
29:59.321 --> 30:00.041
You look so tense.

784
30:04.361 --> 30:05.841
Teach me, please.

785
30:06.002 --> 30:06.722
How do I quickly

786
30:06.801 --> 30:07.841
fit into the workplace?

787
30:08.682 --> 30:10.162
I built myself up gradually.

788
30:10.682 --> 30:11.841
I'm still grateful

789
30:11.841 --> 30:13.761
for my time in sales.

790
30:14.482 --> 30:15.841
Without that experience,

791
30:16.402 --> 30:17.002
I wouldn't

792
30:17.041 --> 30:18.361
be able to run Jiali today.

793
30:19.081 --> 30:20.202
It's not a dark past.

794
30:20.601 --> 30:21.642
It's how I got here.

795
30:25.041 --> 30:26.922
You're so amazing.

796
30:27.882 --> 30:29.321
Did your female clients back then

797
30:30.081 --> 30:31.121
ever hit on you?

798
30:32.962 --> 30:34.002
I was professional.

799
30:34.081 --> 30:34.841
What about friends?

800
30:35.561 --> 30:36.521
Or colleagues?

801
30:36.922 --> 30:38.041
Don't people say

802
30:38.601 --> 30:39.642
a stable earner

803
30:39.841 --> 30:41.402
should pair with a high earner?

804
30:42.162 --> 30:42.801
No one

805
30:42.801 --> 30:44.081
tried to set you up

806
30:44.841 --> 30:48.041
with pretty teachers

807
30:48.242 --> 30:49.202
or nurses?

808
30:53.521 --> 30:54.361
I didn't want it,

809
30:54.962 --> 30:56.442
so I wore a ring.

810
30:57.202 --> 30:58.601
Most people assumed I was married.

811
31:00.722 --> 31:01.962
Liar.

812
31:03.081 --> 31:04.121
When we first met,

813
31:04.121 --> 31:05.402
you weren't wearing a ring.

814
31:06.121 --> 31:06.642
It's true.

815
31:08.081 --> 31:09.482
I fell for you at first sight,

816
31:09.929 --> 31:11.442
so I didn't want you to get me wrong.

817
31:11.442 --> 31:12.402
I don't believe you.

818
31:12.561 --> 31:13.521
I was in such a mess

819
31:13.682 --> 31:14.442
back then.

820
31:15.281 --> 31:15.962
Tell me then,

821
31:16.642 --> 31:17.722
what did you like about me?

822
31:18.081 --> 31:18.949
When I first saw you,

823
31:19.321 --> 31:20.442
I wanted to protect you.

824
31:21.202 --> 31:22.242
Why else would I chase

825
31:22.281 --> 31:23.002
after the driver?

826
31:23.482 --> 31:24.081
Logically,

827
31:24.642 --> 31:25.801
we didn't know each other.

828
31:26.202 --> 31:27.121
Calling an ambulance

829
31:27.121 --> 31:27.761
was enough.

830
31:41.682 --> 31:42.801
Where did this go?

831
31:43.601 --> 31:44.242
Didn't you

832
31:44.402 --> 31:45.202
ask for advice?

833
31:46.442 --> 31:47.601
I just can't get it, honey.

834
31:48.202 --> 31:49.482
It's too hard.

835
31:50.002 --> 31:50.962
Then don't bother.

836
31:51.361 --> 31:52.187
Leave it all to me.

837
32:10.041 --> 32:10.521
Where's she?

838
32:11.162 --> 32:11.642
Sleeping.

839
32:15.521 --> 32:16.162
What happened?

840
32:16.361 --> 32:17.242
It's just a cut.

841
32:19.521 --> 32:21.442
Why did she suddenly call you Yong?

842
32:22.281 --> 32:23.242
She knows the name.

843
32:24.321 --> 32:25.242
I told her before.

844
32:25.682 --> 32:26.202
You told her

845
32:26.202 --> 32:27.242
a lot about your past?

846
32:27.922 --> 32:29.482
My former name is on the registry.

847
32:29.922 --> 32:31.081
What was I supposed to do?

848
32:33.081 --> 32:34.642
So in your version of the story,

849
32:35.242 --> 32:36.561
it was love at first sight.

850
32:36.801 --> 32:38.482
I was just humoring her.

851
32:39.321 --> 32:40.482
She's just like a child.

852
32:41.002 --> 32:42.922
All she thinks about is shopping,

853
32:43.041 --> 32:43.801
hanging out,

854
32:44.121 --> 32:45.002
and being loved.

855
32:45.202 --> 32:46.121
She needs pampering.

856
32:46.442 --> 32:48.162
Only people in love baby their partners.

857
32:49.642 --> 32:51.081
You looked happy humoring her.

858
32:51.561 --> 32:52.642
I have no choice.

859
32:56.002 --> 32:57.442
But right now, I can't figure out

860
32:57.882 --> 32:59.242
what she's really up to.

861
32:59.601 --> 33:00.402
At first, I thought

862
33:00.561 --> 33:01.601
she wanted to bust me,

863
33:02.361 --> 33:03.561
suspecting an office affair.

864
33:04.041 --> 33:05.242
So she went back to work.

865
33:05.642 --> 33:07.041
Do you have an office affair?

866
33:12.081 --> 33:13.162
She dropped the case.

867
33:13.682 --> 33:14.801
I thought she was done,

868
33:15.361 --> 33:16.682
yet she still moved out.

869
33:17.081 --> 33:17.882
It's not because of

870
33:17.882 --> 33:18.442
her injury.

871
33:18.922 --> 33:19.761
She just doesn't want

872
33:19.801 --> 33:20.761
to sleep with me.

873
33:21.801 --> 33:22.722
So now

874
33:22.722 --> 33:23.722
you're discussing with me

875
33:23.722 --> 33:24.321
why she won't

876
33:24.361 --> 33:25.281
sleep with you?

877
33:28.922 --> 33:30.521
Aren't you here to help me?

878
33:31.601 --> 33:33.121
Isn't this part of the plan?

879
33:34.361 --> 33:35.321
What's wrong with you?

880
33:35.761 --> 33:36.321
Fang Yong.

881
33:37.081 --> 33:38.121
If I didn't know you,

882
33:38.801 --> 33:39.561
hearing that,

883
33:40.321 --> 33:41.642
I'd think you actually love her.

884
34:13.121 --> 34:14.402
(Her attitude)

885
34:14.842 --> 34:15.681
(has changed a bit.)

886
34:17.762 --> 34:19.282
(Strike while the iron is hot.)

887
34:42.002 --> 34:42.641
Hello.

888
34:42.802 --> 34:43.962
You need to register here.

889
34:52.362 --> 34:52.842
Ms. Hui.

890
34:54.802 --> 34:55.201
Hello.

891
34:55.798 --> 34:56.362
Mrs. Di said

892
34:56.362 --> 34:57.442
it's your first time here,

893
34:57.442 --> 34:58.322
so she sent me here.

894
34:59.041 --> 34:59.521
This way.

895
35:01.081 --> 35:01.641
Thanks.

896
35:02.362 --> 35:03.882
I thought this was Jiali.

897
35:04.362 --> 35:05.362
It startled me.

898
35:05.842 --> 35:06.601
I wondered

899
35:06.601 --> 35:07.601
why it was so bare.

900
35:09.442 --> 35:10.681
Ms. Hui, you're hilarious.

901
35:11.002 --> 35:12.161
How could this be Jiali?

902
35:13.081 --> 35:14.842
I happen to have stuff to do here,

903
35:15.041 --> 35:15.882
so I had Zhang Tao

904
35:15.962 --> 35:16.922
bring you over.

905
35:17.201 --> 35:18.081
Thank you for coming.

906
35:18.681 --> 35:19.241
Not at all.

907
35:19.802 --> 35:20.322
Ms. Hui,

908
35:20.762 --> 35:22.121
if you're not in a rush,

909
35:22.402 --> 35:23.641
why not take a walk around

910
35:23.842 --> 35:24.601
with me?

911
35:24.882 --> 35:25.842
I want

912
35:25.882 --> 35:27.402
to view this floor for Liren.

913
35:28.362 --> 35:28.721
Sure.

914
35:29.802 --> 35:30.561
Watch your step.

915
35:32.482 --> 35:34.402
This floor just opened up.

916
35:34.521 --> 35:35.842
The previous firm went bankrupt

917
35:35.842 --> 35:36.442
and moved out,

918
35:36.882 --> 35:39.322
so Liren wants to take it over.

919
35:39.962 --> 35:40.601
Any ideas?

920
35:41.962 --> 35:43.041
I don't know anything

921
35:43.081 --> 35:43.922
about business.

922
35:45.521 --> 35:46.521
Neither do I.

923
35:47.322 --> 35:48.721
I even asked Liren about this.

924
35:49.201 --> 35:50.282
Jiali

925
35:50.322 --> 35:51.362
already has two floors.

926
35:51.561 --> 35:52.641
So why get another one?

927
35:53.442 --> 35:54.762
But Liren told me

928
35:54.962 --> 35:57.002
we can't just look at the present.

929
35:57.322 --> 35:59.161
We have to plan for five, ten years ahead.

930
35:59.362 --> 35:59.962
We will be

931
36:00.002 --> 36:00.882
totally short on room.

932
36:04.121 --> 36:05.561
Liren is so ambitious,

933
36:06.161 --> 36:06.962
with a huge goal.

934
36:07.561 --> 36:08.362
Then again,

935
36:08.762 --> 36:09.322
that's exactly

936
36:09.322 --> 36:10.161
why I love him.

937
36:12.402 --> 36:13.402
The rent for this floor

938
36:13.762 --> 36:14.882
must be very high.

939
36:15.241 --> 36:15.882
You bet.

940
36:16.201 --> 36:16.882
It's a fortune.

941
36:17.641 --> 36:18.721
So he wants to buy it

942
36:19.161 --> 36:20.641
instead of renting.

943
36:22.241 --> 36:24.161
That's a huge expense.

944
36:25.002 --> 36:26.161
Will he struggle financially?

945
36:28.002 --> 36:28.882
Liren

946
36:28.882 --> 36:29.842
seems quite confident.

947
36:30.041 --> 36:31.041
He's sure to earn it back

948
36:31.201 --> 36:32.282
in five years.

949
36:33.041 --> 36:35.482
Plus, real estate holds its value,

950
36:35.641 --> 36:36.442
and eventually,

951
36:36.641 --> 36:37.282
we can give it

952
36:37.322 --> 36:38.241
to our kids.

953
36:41.121 --> 36:42.362
Mr. Di is very thoughtful.

954
36:42.922 --> 36:43.282
Oh,

955
36:43.721 --> 36:44.121
he wants

956
36:44.121 --> 36:45.201
to move both my office

957
36:45.201 --> 36:46.081
and his

958
36:46.081 --> 36:46.962
down here.

959
36:47.442 --> 36:49.482
After all, upstairs is getting cramped.

960
36:50.201 --> 36:50.681
What?

961
36:51.402 --> 36:52.521
I'm so sorry, Ms. Hui.

962
36:52.962 --> 36:54.721
I've been rambling on and on.

963
36:54.721 --> 36:55.802
I don't even know

964
36:55.882 --> 36:56.762
if this bores you.

965
36:57.561 --> 36:59.641
I've never heard about this stuff before.

966
36:59.882 --> 37:00.802
Sounds interesting.

967
37:02.362 --> 37:02.882
That's good.

968
37:04.282 --> 37:04.762
All right.

969
37:04.962 --> 37:06.201
I'm about done looking around.

970
37:06.601 --> 37:07.121
Let's go.

971
37:07.762 --> 37:08.201
Okay.

972
37:12.601 --> 37:14.041
Could I visit Jiali?

973
37:16.802 --> 37:18.081
Hearing you talk about it

974
37:18.322 --> 37:19.362
got me curious.

975
37:20.002 --> 37:21.041
But if it's inconvenient,

976
37:21.081 --> 37:21.601
never mind.

977
37:22.721 --> 37:23.681
- You can... - Honey.

978
37:24.322 --> 37:24.889
Just got here.

979
37:25.362 --> 37:26.121
Zhang Tao said...

980
37:27.802 --> 37:28.322
Ms. Hui?

981
37:32.922 --> 37:34.041
What a coincidence, honey.

982
37:34.521 --> 37:35.962
Ms. Hui was just asking

983
37:36.282 --> 37:37.802
if she could take a tour

984
37:37.962 --> 37:38.922
of Jiali.

985
37:39.121 --> 37:39.762
Of course,

986
37:39.802 --> 37:40.641
she can.

987
37:41.081 --> 37:41.802
Ms. Hui

988
37:41.882 --> 37:42.842
is like family to us.

989
37:43.081 --> 37:44.161
Why can't she look around?

990
37:44.842 --> 37:46.002
What do you say, honey?

991
37:49.482 --> 37:50.081
I have

992
37:50.161 --> 37:50.882
another meeting.

993
37:51.521 --> 37:52.322
You decide.

994
38:21.081 --> 38:21.842
Get me a coffee.

995
38:22.282 --> 38:22.601
Sure.

996
38:22.802 --> 38:23.788
What coffee do you want?

997
38:26.922 --> 38:27.922
The most expensive one.

998
38:28.282 --> 38:28.922
I'm sorry,

999
38:29.121 --> 38:30.002
all the coffee here

1000
38:30.002 --> 38:30.802
is free.

1001
38:32.121 --> 38:33.201
Here is the thing.

1002
38:33.442 --> 38:34.322
This lounge

1003
38:34.322 --> 38:35.482
was set up by Mr. Di

1004
38:35.482 --> 38:36.362
as an employee perk.

1005
38:36.641 --> 38:38.161
People not only grab coffee here,

1006
38:38.362 --> 38:39.681
they can also bring clients over

1007
38:39.681 --> 38:40.601
to chat.

1008
38:41.161 --> 38:41.842
No charge

1009
38:41.842 --> 38:42.790
for staff or guests.

1010
38:53.161 --> 38:54.201
Are you the new cleaner?

1011
38:55.561 --> 38:56.362
No, I'm not.

1012
38:57.161 --> 38:58.601
Didn't you just call and say

1013
38:58.601 --> 38:59.402
you arrived?

1014
38:59.922 --> 39:00.842
I told you, I'm not.

1015
39:20.762 --> 39:21.641
Why did you go

1016
39:21.641 --> 39:22.842
to the office without a word?

1017
39:23.442 --> 39:24.721
Yu Meng called me there.

1018
39:25.161 --> 39:26.641
I texted you, but you didn't reply.

1019
39:27.081 --> 39:28.362
Don't go to the office again.

1020
39:29.081 --> 39:30.521
Do you know how risky that is?

1021
39:31.161 --> 39:32.081
If someone finds out,

1022
39:32.121 --> 39:33.081
how do I explain it?

1023
39:34.561 --> 39:35.442
Find out what?

1024
39:36.081 --> 39:37.081
Who would recognize me?

1025
39:40.922 --> 39:42.402
I'm worried about you.

1026
39:43.641 --> 39:44.922
You seem off lately.

1027
39:45.121 --> 39:46.121
Can't you tell?

1028
39:47.161 --> 39:48.002
I'm worried too.

1029
39:49.081 --> 39:50.201
I think the one who's off

1030
39:50.241 --> 39:50.721
is you.

1031
39:51.762 --> 39:52.601
You already

1032
39:52.641 --> 39:53.482
made long-term plans,

1033
39:53.681 --> 39:55.041
taking over another floor.

1034
39:56.081 --> 39:57.641
Are you really leaving in three months?

1035
39:59.882 --> 40:01.762
That's just fundraising talk.

1036
40:02.002 --> 40:02.681
Can you prove it?

1037
40:03.362 --> 40:04.442
Ever wonder why we have to

1038
40:04.601 --> 40:05.322
wait three months?

